#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:85
msgid ""
"The <application>MATE Control Center</application> provides a single window "
"from which to launch all preference tools."
msgstr ""
"<application>ສູນຄວບຄຸມ MATE</application> ສະໜອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມດຽວເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົ"
"ດ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:88
msgid ""
"For help on using preference tools, see the <ulink type=\"help\" "
"url=\"help:mate-user-guide/prefs\">User Guide</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃນການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ <ulink type=\"help\" "
"url=\"help:mate-user-guide/prefs\">ຄູ່ມືຜູ້ໃຊ້</ulink>."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/title
#: C/index.docbook:94
msgid "To Start MATE Control Center"
msgstr "ວິທີເລີ່ມໃຊ້ ສູນຄວບຄຸມ MATE"

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:95
msgid ""
"You can start <application>MATE Control Center</application> in the "
"following ways:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລີ່ມ <application>ສູນຄວບຄຸມ MATE</application> ໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

