msgstr ""
"<_:guilabel-1/>: ໃຊ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບຄວາມໄວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເມົາສ໌ຈະເລີ່ມເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວ"

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/config-mouse.xml:83
msgid ""
"For example, by setting the sensitivity to its lowest, the mouse will move "
